  "description": "My life after losing you.\n\nEvery night, I still picture Bangwool waking me in the morning, waiting by the door for my return, the two of us going out for night walks... But she's gone now, and all I have is grief and regret. She was more than a pet — she was family. I know she'd hate to see me so sad. But how do I move on?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes an epilogue.*",
